---
description: Build secure thin Express boundaries validated by Zod.
globs: "src/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep route registration and controllers free of business workflows.
- Validate params, query, headers when relevant, and body with Zod at the boundary.
- Derive authenticated identity and permissions from trusted middleware, never request-supplied actor IDs.
- Pass typed commands/queries into application use cases.
- Map domain/application errors consistently without leaking internals.
- Do not trust browser-calculated eligibility, totals, status, or financial values.
- Document endpoint authorization and integration-test success and failure paths.
